Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.42,0:02:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,钟乳洞你们台湾也有吧 张景岚同学
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.42,0:02:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.76,0:02:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.76,0:02:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.60,0:02:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,但是没有日本这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.60,0:02:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.26,0:02:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我也没去过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.10,0:02:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是第一次来搞洞探咯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.77,0:02:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,洞tang
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.77,0:02:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,就是洞穴探险啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.94,0:02:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,伊吹同学也是第一次吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.94,0:02:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我去过飞弹的大钟乳洞
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.94,0:02:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.28,0:02:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,哇~
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.28,0:02:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,探洞很黑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.72,0:02:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 我也是第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.89,0:03:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,话说 为啥去桥立钟乳洞
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.89,0:03:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.06,0:03:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这回可是带张景岚同学来玩
Comment: 0,0:03:01.06,0:03:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,（查下是地名还是过河）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.89,0:03:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不去川越嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.89,0:03:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,凉快点比较好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.06,0:03:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,川越那太热了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.06,0:03:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,阿巴阿巴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.40,0:03:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我怕热
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.57,0:03:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,凉快点很棒耶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.74,0:03:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1144,994)}很棒耶{\fscx50}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.08,0:03:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.09,0:03:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,入口在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.09,0:03:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,进来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.93,0:03:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好凉快呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.93,0:03:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,还能听到回声
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.77,0:03:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,地很滑 当心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.39,0:04:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,张景岚同学 来这边一周了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.39,0:04:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,习惯宿舍生活了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.56,0:04:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,习惯了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.56,0:04:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.56,0:04:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么麻烦记得说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.07,0:04:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,没有麻烦也可以说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.07,0:04:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.41,0:04:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,就算她不是日本人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.41,0:04:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.24,0:04:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,也是那种很酷的人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.25,0:04:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.70,0:04:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.71,0:05:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.71,0:05:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(344,814)\c&H0000FFFF}景岚酱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.71,0:05:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.22,0:05:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.22,0:05:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,瓦 瓦达西
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.39,0:05:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,今天的探洞就到这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.06,0:05:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,狭窄又漆黑还阴森又寒冷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.06,0:05:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.23,0:05:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,而且还很潮湿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.57,0:05:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得你应该是那种认真的人的
Comment: 0,0:05:25.57,0:05:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(384,994)\c&H0000FFFF\fscx50}思ってたよりガチ{\fscx100}のやつだったね{\fscx50}。（个人理解可能有误）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.90,0:05:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,哎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.90,0:05:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,上伊那你那边还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.08,0:05:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,伊吹同学  我过会过去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.08,0:05:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.75,0:05:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,别害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.92,0:05:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,快 站起来 景岚酱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.26,0:05:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,抓紧我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.36,0:06:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,应该读对了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.36,0:06:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,（张景岚）Zhang Jing Lan对吧，名字
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.39,0:06:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,让你久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.40,0:06:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,呜呜 累坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.57,0:06:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,明明比外面凉快
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.57,0:06:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,结果还出了一身汗了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.91,0:06:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.91,0:06:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那个 牡丹 张景岚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.41,0:06:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,要来点什
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.41,0:06:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,牡丹同学
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.25,0:06:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.25,0:06:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯我原先没想到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.42,0:06:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,, 会那么狭窄
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.85,0:06:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 的手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.87,0:07:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,张景岚同学吃好快
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.04,0:07:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,芒果的zao冰我喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.04,0:07:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,啥
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.04,0:07:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,zao冰 这个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.38,0:07:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,张景岚还有什么喜欢的东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.05,0:07:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.72,0:07:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.22,0:07:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,咦张景岚多少岁了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.22,0:07:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.22,0:07:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,２０岁 台湾18可以喝酒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.73,0:07:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好呢 那我们3个在这开个酒趴吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.73,0:07:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.73,0:07:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 那个 伊吹同学她 现在
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.73,0:07:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.57,0:07:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,遗憾 那牡丹我们一起去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.57,0:07:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.08,0:07:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 那个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.68,0:07:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.68,0:07:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.52,0:07:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.69,0:08:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉像是脑袋挨了一记重锤
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.20,0:08:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,又被一盆冷水当头浇醒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.20,0:08:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.20,0:08:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,二年级学园祭的庆功会
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.04,0:08:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.87,0:08:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那个砺波伊吹同学
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.54,0:08:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.54,0:08:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你很吵
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.71,0:08:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,喝酒的时候可以安静点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.71,0:08:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.22,0:08:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.22,0:08:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那时我第一次喝酒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.05,0:08:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.72,0:08:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,MA真HO幌LLO的BA酒R吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.90,0:08:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,MA真HO幌LLO?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.90,0:08:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,张景岚 你要喝什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.23,0:08:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,来了 酒吧菜单
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.23,0:08:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,哦吼吼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.24,0:08:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.84,0:08:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这些都是啤酒吗 有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.51,0:08:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这个華熊啤酒 我在埼玉喝过
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.51,0:08:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.85,0:09:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我们还喝过ＩＰＡ（India Pale Ale / 印度淡色艾尔** 🍺）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.85,0:09:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.69,0:09:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,对对 这可是伊吹最喜欢的酒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.69,0:09:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.52,0:09:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 你要喝什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.52,0:09:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.86,0:09:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么挑？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.86,0:09:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这家店有很多种啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.70,0:09:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我要怎么挑选呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.03,0:09:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是凭直觉吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.03,0:09:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我是凭酒名挑的～
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.87,0:09:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,其实就是直觉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.21,0:09:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.21,0:09:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,到头来 还是得依赖直觉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.21,0:09:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.21,0:09:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,但是挑选的准则还是有的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.21,0:09:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,啤酒类型  苦度(IBU) 和度数
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.38,0:09:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,一定程度上能预测精酿啤酒味道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.55,0:09:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,喝精酿啤酒喝得多了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.55,0:09:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,会慢慢知道自己偏爱哪些风格
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.39,0:09:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,看到陌生的啤酒也能判断 🍺
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.56,0:09:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,哇
Comment: 0,0:09:44.56,0:09:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(504,634)\c&H0000FFFF}うちの親{\fscx50}　スタイル{\fscx100}なんて気にして（可能有误）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.56,0:09:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我家里人就是看啤酒类型买的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.06,0:09:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈，日本卖的啤酒基本都是拉格（Lager）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.06,0:09:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.40,0:09:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,所以去居酒屋都喝“生中”
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.40,0:09:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,一般都不会踩雷。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.57,0:09:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不愧是伊吹同学 懂得多
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.74,0:10:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,让您久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.74,0:10:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(504,994)}熊的味噌土豆　{\fscx100}红熊 × {\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.91,0:10:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,和一杯可乐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.91,0:10:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.75,0:10:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.75,0:10:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,伊吹　可乐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.75,0:10:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不喝酒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.75,0:10:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,张景岚 别生气
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.75,0:10:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,她有自己的情况的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.92,0:10:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不能酒桌霸凌别人喝酒的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.92,0:10:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我 要和伊吹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.59,0:10:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,, 一起喝酒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.77,0:10:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈 真难办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.77,0:10:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢喝酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.77,0:10:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我不应该
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.77,0:10:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,来这里的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.28,0:10:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,呐 牡丹和伊吹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.28,0:10:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.78,0:10:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你们私下经常喝酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.78,0:10:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不想和牡丹以外的人喝酒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.78,0:10:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.29,0:10:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,一起来嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.29,0:10:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.29,0:10:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.39,0:10:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,牡丹和我一起来尽情喝酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.73,0:10:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.73,0:10:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.73,0:10:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道为什么 但那样更讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.73,0:11:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,张景岚 我要啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.90,0:11:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.42,0:11:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道这人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.93,0:11:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,喝的很干净呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.60,0:11:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,伊吹
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.60,0:11:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,呜呜
Comment: 0,0:11:30.93,0:11:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了（没理解）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.44,0:11:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,失陪 我去拿新啤酒啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.44,0:11:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯 只有2杯呢 只有我和伊吹的份
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.44,0:11:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.78,0:11:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,来一下 牡丹
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.78,0:11:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(784,994)\c&H00FFFF00}ついてきてくれない？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.61,0:11:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1144,814)\c&H00FFFF00}ひっく{\fscx50}。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.61,0:11:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.78,0:11:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.78,0:11:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,和我去拿啤酒吧 想要一大杯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.22,0:11:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我会等你的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.89,0:11:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 伊吹
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.89,0:11:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.90,0:12:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,该怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.23,0:12:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那个 啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.90,0:12:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,店员 可以送到座位的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.90,0:12:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.41,0:12:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,牡丹
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.91,0:12:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们楼上 是一家民宿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.91,0:12:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.75,0:12:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.09,0:12:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,一起睡嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.09,0:12:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(344,994)\c&H00FFFF00}今晩{\fscx50}。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.27,0:12:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 累死了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.94,0:12:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢人多的喝酒会
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.94,0:12:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我算是彻底明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.94,0:12:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,先前呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.21,0:12:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,随便应付应付过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.22,0:12:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其是我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.22,0:12:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,听不到自己说话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.22,0:12:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,忙忙碌碌　心神不宁
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.72,0:13:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太难受了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.72,0:13:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,为啥那么照顾别人感受
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.56,0:13:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,今天明明就是个特别随意的聚餐嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.56,0:13:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.90,0:13:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,与其说是太顾虑别人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.90,0:13:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不如说我控制不住思考
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.73,0:13:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,比如大家有没有吃饱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.23,0:13:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,会不会有人觉得无聊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.07,0:13:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,明明随便一点就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.41,0:13:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,可我就是这种人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.58,0:13:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 这个我倒是知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.08,0:13:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,茜你不会这样嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.08,0:13:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.75,0:13:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.59,0:13:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,喝到第二天可能会后悔 有点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.59,0:13:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.26,0:13:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.26,0:13:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(464,874)\fscx50}（{\fscx100}あかね{\fscx50}）{\fscx100}昔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.26,0:13:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,先前有这种歌
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.43,0:13:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,单纯喝多了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.43,0:13:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,说了很多话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.93,0:13:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,暴露痴态了哦 有点害羞
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.93,0:13:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(344,994)}痴态{\fscx50}。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.10,0:13:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,看不下去的状态哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.27,0:13:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.27,0:13:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你也该多懂点人情世故了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.54,0:13:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,哈 今日还好 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.04,0:13:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,没喝多
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.38,0:13:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,何况还有你在
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.88,0:14:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,嘛 有你在我也能放松点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.88,0:14:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.05,0:14:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,和谁一起喝果然很关键呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.05,0:14:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(384,994)}結構大事よね{\fscx50}。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.22,0:14:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,看来我们很般配呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.39,0:14:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.06,0:14:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.06,0:14:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在一起就好了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.57,0:14:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还是折中一下好嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.57,0:14:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.07,0:14:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,对的对的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.07,0:14:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,无语
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.08,0:14:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,张景岚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.42,0:14:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,张同学
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.42,0:14:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,有 意 思
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.26,0:14:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,她喝倒了好像
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.60,0:14:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,她还真能喝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.60,0:14:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,牡丹
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.37,0:14:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.37,0:14:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.04,0:15:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.04,0:15:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,张景岚还好嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.54,0:15:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.71,0:15:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我 想 喝 水
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,啥
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,水水
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.39,0:15:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.39,0:15:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,张景岚 再撑一下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.22,0:15:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.39,0:15:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.90,0:15:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,请在这签下你和同住者的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.90,0:15:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.40,0:15:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,今天本店只有您入住
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.40,0:15:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\p
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.07,0:15:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,公共部分也可以随便使用
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.07,0:15:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.41,0:15:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,万分感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.91,0:15:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,伊吹同学 我带张景岚先去房间了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.91,0:15:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.92,0:15:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,看她这样子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.92,0:15:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,先让她睡比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.25,0:15:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.25,0:15:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我先了解入住规则
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.25,0:15:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 这是钥匙 207房间
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.25,0:15:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.70,0:16:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,张景岚 站的了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.70,0:16:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.37,0:16:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿呀~
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.37,0:16:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,放轻松 可以靠着我哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.37,0:16:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.71,0:16:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,小心台阶哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.71,0:16:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.39,0:16:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,鞋放在这
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.41,0:16:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,公共区域好大呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.52,0:16:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,2 0 7 207房间
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.36,0:17:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,歇会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.70,0:17:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈我要喝水
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.37,0:17:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,张景岚　床马上铺好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.37,0:17:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,困吗 困睡被子上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.37,0:17:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.22,0:17:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来不太能喝呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.89,0:17:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,租房或许是对的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.56,0:17:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,一开始 伊吹的打算是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.73,0:17:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是只想我和她一起睡的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.73,0:17:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.90,0:17:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,照这样发展下去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.90,0:17:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.73,0:17:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,仔细想想就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.57,0:17:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,就知道了...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.01,0:17:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 张景岚\N\N
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.68,0:17:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,睡觉了 谢谢铺的被子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.02,0:18:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,伊吹呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.02,0:18:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,她 她还在外面
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.69,0:18:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,想对伊吹说谢谢 明天
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.69,0:18:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.03,0:18:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢带我来喝酒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.03,0:18:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.54,0:18:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我第一次 睡榻榻米 好好闻 像森林
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.54,0:18:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.05,0:18:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,呐 牡丹
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.05,0:18:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢伊吹对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.23,0:18:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 水来了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.23,0:18:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,公共区域的冰箱里放着饮料
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.23,0:18:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.57,0:18:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,付钱就有的喝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.01,0:18:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,张同学 睡着了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.34,0:18:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,旁边的房间有水呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.51,0:18:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,她看起来没有觉得不舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.01,0:19:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,呐 牡丹
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.18,0:19:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,牡丹？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.52,0:19:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我没喝够
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.36,0:19:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我还要喝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.03,0:19:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,和伊吹
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.37,0:19:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.37,0:19:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是 没喝够
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.05,0:19:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,啊日本酒 这都是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.05,0:19:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 500日元
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.05,0:19:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,秩父啤酒也有卖
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.05,0:19:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这里可以用吗
Comment: 0,0:19:41.72,0:19:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1144,994)\c&H00FFFF00}って聞いた{\fscx50}。上下文存疑
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.23,0:19:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,坐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.08,0:20:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.08,0:20:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.08,0:20:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.08,0:20:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我还要喝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.08,0:20:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好喝嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.42,0:20:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好喝嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.26,0:20:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,一下就喝完了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.26,0:20:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好 那我慢慢喝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.93,0:20:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,今天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.93,0:20:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉真的很久没和别人一起喝酒了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.60,0:20:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.60,0:20:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不是一直和我一起喝的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.60,0:20:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.94,0:20:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.44,0:20:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但也不是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.78,0:20:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里不是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.95,0:20:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.45,0:20:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.12,0:20:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.12,0:20:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我的特别的人 你明白吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.07,0:21:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,注意到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.07,0:21:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.74,0:21:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我 不知不觉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.74,0:21:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,即使喝的是没有气泡的酒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.74,0:21:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.25,0:21:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,也会打嗝了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.25,0:21:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.75,0:21:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(704,994)\c&H00FFFF00}ひっく{\fscx50}。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.26,0:21:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这下 我们真的是一对了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.26,0:21:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(384,994)\c&H0000FFFF}本当に{\fscx50}　{\fscx100}おそろいですね{\fscx50}。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.59,0:21:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(344,994)}♬～
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.39,0:22:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1224,994)\c&H00FFFF00}ひっく…{\fscx50}。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.40,0:22:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(824,814)\c&H00FFFF00}ひっく{\fscx50}。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.40,0:22:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(344,994)\c&H0000FFFF}うっぷ…{\fscx50}。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.40,0:22:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1304,814)\c&H00FFFF00}ひっく{\fscx50}。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.40,0:22:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(984,994)\c&H0000FFFF}うっぷ…{\fscx50}。
